---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="API Reference — Security Checker" description="REST API endpoints for the Security Checker.">
  <article class="docs-content">
    <h1>API Reference</h1>

    <p>The Security Checker API runs on port <code>8787</code> by default.</p>

    <h2>Endpoints</h2>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>POST</code></td><td><code>/api/audit</code></td><td>Start a new security audit</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/audit/:id/progress</code></td><td>SSE progress stream</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/report/:id</code></td><td>Full audit report</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/report/:id/export/csv</code></td><td>Export as CSV</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/report/:id/export/md</code></td><td>Export as Markdown</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/rules?q=query</code></td><td>Search security rules</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/rules/detail?id=rule_id</code></td><td>Get rule details</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET</code></td><td><code>/api/health</code></td><td>Health check</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Start an Audit</h2>
    <pre><code set:text={`curl -X POST http://localhost:8787/api/audit \\
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\
  -d '{
    "folder_path": "/path/to/project",
    "language": "go",
    "platform": "docker",
    "min_severity": "high"
  }'`} /></pre>

    <h3>Response</h3>
    <pre><code set:text={`{
  "session_id": "abc123...",
  "total_rules": 875,
  "rules_url": "http://localhost:8788/audit/abc123/rules.json",
  "results_url": "http://localhost:8788/audit/abc123/results",
  "message": "875 security rules to check..."
}`} /></pre>

    <h2>Get Report</h2>
    <pre><code>curl http://localhost:8787/api/report/abc123</code></pre>

    <h2>Search Rules</h2>
    <pre><code>curl "http://localhost:8787/api/rules?q=SQL+injection"</code></pre>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .docs-content { max-width: 700px; }

  .docs-content h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .docs-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .docs-content h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .docs-content p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .docs-content pre {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .docs-content code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  th, td {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  th {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  td { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  td code { background: var(--surface-2); padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem; border-radius: 3px; }
</style>
